All log lines in dataset/ are synthetic, generated by scripts/generate.py
from configs/templates.yaml. No real hosts, users, or addresses appear.
IP addresses use only documentation ranges (RFC 5737: 192.0.2.0/24,
198.51.100.0/24, 203.0.113.0/24) and RFC 1918 private ranges.

Metric formulas in seclog/metrics.py are an independent Apache-2.0
implementation of the LogHub-2.0 scores (Jiang et al., ISSTA'24, section 4.2).
They do not copy logpai/Loghub-2.0 benchmark/evaluation (GPL-3).

